{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/9fgwzcur8gyc5r2l4m4zufkmca7i563.mp3","text":"我可以保护你，也可以帮你处理一些麻烦。但你最好向我证明这样做的价值。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_001.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/sj3ogqfap5nnp5g2ndf2jimeb7t94te.mp3","text":"我可以保护你，也可以帮你处理一些麻烦。但你最好向我证明这样做的价值。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/3wewq2dt1u6wuhhap3t1okc8meo02ne.mp3","text":"罗德岛与龙门的事已经是不方便提起的旧案，但有许多人因你们的行动获救却是事实。我花了许多时间来检验罗德岛是否可信。至于结论，罗德岛还能在这里设立办事处就是证明。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/q0eiy36g3ml4b408ue3zgv0187d1gqx.mp3","text":"你应该已经和鲤先生有过合作，你的确可以信任他的情报。但有时候，私家侦探能做的毕竟有限。一些不方便麻烦他的事，可以来找我。当然，我也会尽量不让麻烦事找上罗德岛。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/65/0chvut2nvuuh7k5ni2xy6phev8u3anr.mp3","text":"刚才看到诗怀雅也在这里，难得她还能在这些事上亲力亲为。按以前的理想，她现在应该是龙门商会领袖，我大概会在大学当老师。不，不用去打招呼。以她的身份，在工作场合和我见面，不像话。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_004.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/fy3gl8qit1joxec1i2xudeq18oey73a.mp3","text":"罗德岛与龙门的事已经是不方便提起的旧案，但有许多人因你们的行动获救却是事实。我花了许多时间来检验罗德岛是否可信。至于结论，罗德岛还能在这里设立办事处就是证明。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/47/96bw8b6efw96fy5w48rhecfp641b6dt.mp3","text":"你应该已经和鲤先生有过合作，你的确可以信任他的情报。但有时候，私家侦探能做的毕竟有限。一些不方便麻烦他的事，可以来找我。当然，我也会尽量不让麻烦事找上罗德岛。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/qvjh0mqf4jedca9gde6qfd4p2kgv27i.mp3","text":"刚才看到诗怀雅也在这里，难得她还能在这些事上亲力亲为。按以前的理想，她现在应该是龙门商会领袖，我大概会在大学当老师。不，不用去打招呼。以她的身份，在工作场合和我见面，不像话。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/e5nhowtvlbf0xj3y3f3b4lh5p8yz6dm.mp3","text":"父亲经常穿着的那件大衣，是我送给他的生日礼物。见惯了他在人前威严的模样，有时连我自己都忘了，那件大衣下面是一个老人日渐瘦弱的肩膀。他肩上的担子，需要有人来接。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/9gmchjfbi42i9x3rdns34d2dsv64vge.mp3","text":"在一些人眼里，贫民区是一个要解决的问题；对另一些人来说，这里是生活的地方。“贫民区”和“下城区”两个名字之间的距离，可能是几代人的努力。我不确定自己能做到哪一步，但我会做下去。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_006.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/80/nvx31g1hjgmjnbbatjcypdvi82snug7.mp3","text":"父亲经常穿着的那件大衣，是我送给他的生日礼物。见惯了他在人前威严的模样，有时连我自己都忘了，那件大衣下面是一个老人日渐瘦弱的肩膀。他肩上的担子，需要有人来接。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/19/3wqkbu58s2x48gnqlrm4w38tfqxqzbi.mp3","text":"在一些人眼里，贫民区是一个要解决的问题；对另一些人来说，这里是生活的地方。“贫民区”和“下城区”两个名字之间的距离，可能是几代人的努力。我不确定自己能做到哪一步，但我会做下去。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/3ck2bh7jho1kx55lcbejeg813x3br0l.mp3","text":"我好像还从来没有在罗德岛见过陈的影子，她总有自己的事要做，对吧？也不知道招揽这样的干员到底对你们有什么好处......我和她的关系没那么好，但她的确让我看到了另一种选择的可能。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/6cpq1jh9ncuqjemcximtmk9bi2uac4k.mp3","text":"刚才没事，帮你修剪了一下桌上的盆景。就算事务繁忙，在生活中保持一点审美还是很有必要的——为什么这么惊讶？琴棋书画，插花茶道，这都是我以前的必修课......看不出来？算了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/eipsbpmgk1pkmhfd3heh6nl1cj5fnvr.mp3","text":"眼前的这片夜景，和我儿时记忆里的已经大不相同。龙门发展日新月异，也依然有霓虹灯无法照亮的角落......跟我去喝一杯？在凌晨的街道上，你才能看到一个城市最真实的样子。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_009.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/86/6ohfyzxz0mcfxiptlvoyw52en1yyt6v.mp3","text":"我好像还从来没有在罗德岛见过陈的影子，她总有自己的事要做，对吧？也不知道招揽这样的干员到底对你们有什么好处......我和她的关系没那么好，但她的确让我看到了另一种选择的可能。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/0rqx8iqw5yi77wc8i93f8c3sdnv27n7.mp3","text":"刚才没事，帮你修剪了一下桌上的盆景。就算事务繁忙，在生活中保持一点审美还是很有必要的——为什么这么惊讶？琴棋书画，插花茶道，这都是我以前的必修课......看不出来？算了。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/5n0av9tig2d82q0yflpw4p6shkrllds.mp3","text":"眼前的这片夜景，和我儿时记忆里的已经大不相同。龙门发展日新月异，也依然有霓虹灯无法照亮的角落......跟我去喝一杯？在凌晨的街道上，你才能看到一个城市最真实的样子。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:1/16/tbqwkupqec1wfjj1dcgvbbb0qyql69z.mp3","text":"......你疲惫的样子，是不是也不该让太多人看见？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_010.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/81xcdiovjrixqfaf71hna69qjcwfg6v.mp3","text":"......你疲惫的样子，是不是也不该让太多人看见？","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:1/15/sreutzgx3wfyi0d1be71nhtw2g96pm9.mp3","text":"博士，我们之前应该间接打过交道，现在终于有机会正式认识一下了。关于贫民区的感染者问题，由我们直接沟通会方便很多。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_011.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/nwh0vvhdhtutgk89clw603nn7wrrav2.mp3","text":"博士，我们之前应该间接打过交道，现在终于有机会正式认识一下了。关于贫民区的感染者问题，由我们直接沟通会方便很多。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/ekbmqqnsej32bv515r2mqunjkjylynu.mp3","text":"解决麻烦的方式很多，正面冲突通常是我最后的选择。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_012.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/49/02c364dyfp7fiu0fyrnxt2qahm722gp.mp3","text":"解决麻烦的方式很多，正面冲突通常是我最后的选择。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:1/10/8jzyi48dlz6ndc83x9ksh3rtzqitknh.mp3","text":"有时为了方便行事，我也会出席这样的场合。我都记不清自己领过多少头衔，但是到最后，我还是要回到那片阴影里。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_013.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/10/gl4jxva1txrrslo24l0s9hylmfdd0lq.mp3","text":"有时为了方便行事，我也会出席这样的场合。我都记不清自己领过多少头衔，但是到最后，我还是要回到那片阴影里。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/6e7guyq8qqx0ocy0p0curulufm8vf7x.mp3","text":"只要清楚自己在做什么就够了。不是所有荣誉都需要被人知晓，不是所有道路都需要有人同行。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_014.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/13/2ytfkkvg0msm78nciwxo7sbd5k1stw7.mp3","text":"只要清楚自己在做什么就够了。不是所有荣誉都需要被人知晓，不是所有道路都需要有人同行。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e3/goqm5ky179cqlndmqgpyx7ksou4ioj1.mp3","text":"告诉我你想要达成的目的就好，不要过问我会怎么做。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_017.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/70/12fnw9kbd6mkusmox3qpd92qpu43506.mp3","text":"告诉我你想要达成的目的就好，不要过问我会怎么做。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/1g5x1h3pp2w3cu5ngwd7xkebel4t7ja.mp3","text":"要是对目标有疑虑，现在退出还来得及。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_018.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/72/ed8l6d6kjsncsmp8pft6mj04ku4519p.mp3","text":"要是对目标有疑虑，现在退出还来得及。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/kzzzi8lgfocb1o544dgymmzimsq9jg2.mp3","text":"希望不用向你解释什么是“必要的手段”。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_019.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e3/9yfamvgyh724aavm7yit14nfzw8izsr.mp3","text":"希望不用向你解释什么是“必要的手段”。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:1/16/pqc8nmgu5yohgo21g0qim1qg7cx96u8.mp3","text":"坏了规矩的人，就拉出来立个戒吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_020.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/h9d0fa2xnahlfmynhe66zmobs42tr05.mp3","text":"坏了规矩的人，就拉出来立个戒吧。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/3r6sy366276b9q9qxd52d08c3tvjbpc.mp3","text":"晓得了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/66ius8hywrrsjf4778lj2qxuwsqrgbo.mp3","text":"不用多说。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_022.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/brjs29phn1o0gmq7e9hg6ni2xifzvnb.mp3","text":"晓得了。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/14/n88g0bksm2gsxoairttbjk85hfi3eg4.mp3","text":"不用多说。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/c0731yptxrlz5wc0rpttaz44olb8kvr.mp3","text":"小心身后的影子。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/pz1tomsq3p3ygftfn5dyzol2pj2604i.mp3","text":"那就让他们埋葬在这吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_024.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/63wjwayz3ruvkzfxbyjw7wwcstq5a2k.mp3","text":"小心身后的影子。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/pzlefq1p6lxzsqlj3zc5dwi1dfknma3.mp3","text":"那就让他们埋葬在这吧。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/3i5sxst4tarf0srd7729ouz85fcqxcu.mp3","text":"你越界时，从来没有考虑过后果。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/13/7f2j0ofrb2xgninsmnckihh0r2w5mt0.mp3","text":"现在才想谈判，是不是太迟了？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/44/3dpze27qjrd6f92s5yn6a3gbg4c0aop.mp3","text":"给我一个放过你的理由。没有？很可惜。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/n8dwmge9ic4tmhpmyawo61ihqk43g3m.mp3","text":"碎裂吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_028.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/1rhu8v4qxmwfb36yuh4w7xcu4rr77jr.mp3","text":"你越界时，从来没有考虑过后果。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/52/lq4zrdxswefrcwf3bypd0lo7qhcz2lk.mp3","text":"现在才想谈判，是不是太迟了？","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/r7da8cgipnmy6br3zjmz6qudg5c4xak.mp3","text":"给我一个放过你的理由。没有？很可惜。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/74/ktw354buwf39ktsqc3s43j4to4m6p54.mp3","text":"碎裂吧。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/42/rigsol0viwz6tz4wo105p8a15uxsa40.mp3","text":"这一切最好永远都不要被人知晓。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_029.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/b5zd005ej4hdsxynsh1rjhgxj1ebi0l.mp3","text":"这一切最好永远都不要被人知晓。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/iquqscal3xb93cz3a8qxz3ad4046ua8.mp3","text":"处理得很干净，不会有人找到他们的痕迹。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_030.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/10/oqxw8lczf2ol4bbz1dks08xrhnf6ypc.mp3","text":"处理得很干净，不会有人找到他们的痕迹。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/jgn4pyh6vysq3hbcqpditggwb1lpibk.mp3","text":"还在掌控之内的疏漏，剩下的交给我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_031.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/22/8lvyi1v7k4z29h0mjj8f9ms21lhfi72.mp3","text":"还在掌控之内的疏漏，剩下的交给我。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:9/90/hjonl2hblxh4n5kz01dnyyrmfmkto1y.mp3","text":"补救的手段永远都有，别被愤怒冲昏了头。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_032.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/22/12gzj3fw6r9rl8td90licbvna10wop7.mp3","text":"补救的手段永远都有，别被愤怒冲昏了头。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/6f6sgxozgxvi9mr9rzwd5ixxa38o4bb.mp3","text":"不需要太宽敞的地方，但装饰可以再雕琢一下。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_033.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/c800gto91kqu8e9x997n16b6stq3b2s.mp3","text":"不需要太宽敞的地方，但装饰可以再雕琢一下。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/adoppgeueos759gyphu8t04mr6w6b8x.mp3","text":"你最好对刚才的举动有一个解释。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_034.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/86/drqs253xyfe51jn5d8nxpzhq18xo2dc.mp3","text":"你最好对刚才的举动有一个解释。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:1/14/8srrqf88ihcmqzfr503v8hgl98wy9ny.mp3","text":"刚出炉的菠萝油......你也想吃吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_036.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/mp4bo5hk5rtgee3pl0o0devdv127bna.mp3","text":"刚出炉的菠萝油......你也想吃吗？","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:4/43/atbkkyhk4pfe278yhumsvz7aae8iu44.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_037.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/em75i0war3txxjlzg8moqkper6y8hht.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2b/4v4bh2g299r54er2xtlge9wd1rchwad.mp3","text":"新年快乐。爸有一些外国朋友，在这个日子他也会尽一些礼节，而寄去的贺信通常都由我代笔。喏，这封是给你的。这一年来你也操劳了不少事，辛苦了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_038.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/g2jh856d0nbkj6x1g945bcubrh874yo.mp3","text":"新年快乐。爸有一些外国朋友，在这个日子他也会尽一些礼节，而寄去的贺信通常都由我代笔。喏，这封是给你的。这一年来你也操劳了不少事，辛苦了。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/kzg311fosjows42xsywf7niy0d9h3qi.mp3","text":"希望你没有遇到什么麻烦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4080_lin/cn_042.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/83/duaua5zn3l50wtho9j1295mxvr3l7fi.mp3","text":"希望你没有遇到什么麻烦。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4080_lin_cn_topolect/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/gs26uk44wz0rq403gxhvhnl0ihuy98a.mp3","text":"我可以保护你，也可以帮你处理一些麻烦。但你最好向我证明这样做的价值。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/gqkqzrnjoinn7gp4j143i7efuhvt80m.mp3","text":"罗德岛与龙门的事已经是不方便提起的旧案，但有许多人因你们的行动获救却是事实。我花了许多时间来检验罗德岛是否可信。至于结论，罗德岛还能在这里设立办事处就是证明。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/69/tqlj18whaqfsdt11r46l1fgkg0atx41.mp3","text":"你应该已经和鲤先生有过合作，你的确可以信任他的情报。但有时候，私家侦探能做的毕竟有限。一些不方便麻烦他的事，可以来找我。当然，我也会尽量不让麻烦事找上罗德岛。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/juu31hdhdt7l6qy254x9ayqcp3gv1qi.mp3","text":"刚才看到诗怀雅也在这里，难得她还能在这些事上亲力亲为。按以前的理想，她现在应该是龙门商会领袖，我大概会在大学当老师。不，不用去打招呼。以她的身份，在工作场合和我见面，不像话。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/cylaeg8774wp86hlxpj1xmj6k2jlczt.mp3","text":"父亲经常穿着的那件大衣，是我送给他的生日礼物。见惯了他在人前威严的模样，有时连我自己都忘了，那件大衣下面是一个老人日渐瘦弱的肩膀。他肩上的担子，需要有人来接。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/mk03zytnifzjbzqh19zzgoh9hnwgqe9.mp3","text":"在一些人眼里，贫民区是一个要解决的问题；对另一些人来说，这里是生活的地方。“贫民区”和“下城区”两个名字之间的距离，可能是几代人的努力。我不确定自己能做到哪一步，但我会做下去。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/raa93aqn54nli5kbou7yggwo2k1sxs7.mp3","text":"我好像还从来没有在罗德岛见过陈的影子，她总有自己的事要做，对吧？也不知道招揽这样的干员到底对你们有什么好处......我和她的关系没那么好，但她的确让我看到了另一种选择的可能。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/12/s47uiivga725y8uyra8aialxh482p6f.mp3","text":"刚才没事，帮你修剪了一下桌上的盆景。就算事务繁忙，在生活中保持一点审美还是很有必要的——为什么这么惊讶？琴棋书画，插花茶道，这都是我以前的必修课......看不出来？算了。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/51/qw00uzttej22a6r7fx0230tza2vn14t.mp3","text":"眼前的这片夜景，和我儿时记忆里的已经大不相同。龙门发展日新月异，也依然有霓虹灯无法照亮的角落......跟我去喝一杯？在凌晨的街道上，你才能看到一个城市最真实的样子。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:3/37/gmxjpyuufx9vl367it5xqjtywlh0ixa.mp3","text":"......你疲惫的样子，是不是也不该让太多人看见？","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/rji8lhujuah14ynptmj0onikwlqtqjp.mp3","text":"博士，我们之前应该间接打过交道，现在终于有机会正式认识一下了。关于贫民区的感染者问题，由我们直接沟通会方便很多。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/64lhdoon5afs2lyacgzr9f2szjvwfpb.mp3","text":"解决麻烦的方式很多，正面冲突通常是我最后的选择。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/48jry4m40hdvr597muvz3hb1wftj2yl.mp3","text":"有时为了方便行事，我也会出席这样的场合。我都记不清自己领过多少头衔，但是到最后，我还是要回到那片阴影里。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/cao2w408humu1xdun3iccdqrpwl6svl.mp3","text":"只要清楚自己在做什么就够了。不是所有荣誉都需要被人知晓，不是所有道路都需要有人同行。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/bpby48ey677avdqvpmc7ggfwsid16bc.mp3","text":"告诉我你想要达成的目的就好，不要过问我会怎么做。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/0f2hj1p0wrmju0i9iqz3t5xfwof9ioq.mp3","text":"要是对目标有疑虑，现在退出还来得及。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:6/66/86ymdsigklzncu0ujh5y4socv4gbho7.mp3","text":"希望不用向你解释什么是“必要的手段”。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/9dij8jcul8i1dmmfyalanjfw36l28tk.mp3","text":"坏了规矩的人，就拉出来立个戒吧。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:9/90/em1lnqcaytcz2y7cvfb10flwj7k35uz.mp3","text":"晓得了。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7e/ie1s2786mzdpur66lt7t7okcb5hm2gb.mp3","text":"不用多说。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:2/26/68ayw2o1jpgm9ga5qazrz2udfp2gubc.mp3","text":"小心身后的影子。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/6l3kh7ztgpbzw98tveo98wejckhlgfd.mp3","text":"那就让他们埋葬在这吧。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:4/46/hw46pvcvuj6ympxi0qj18ud35vbed7g.mp3","text":"你越界时，从来没有考虑过后果。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/q7pqoxdronn18c35y6qx1oedk8vjd14.mp3","text":"现在才想谈判，是不是太迟了？","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/37/0ucdxvl9vkaf3om7lfx1bcait1eoef2.mp3","text":"给我一个放过你的理由。没有？很可惜。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/ktuchmn9rug8ikz54i4a1gpjlybnhxf.mp3","text":"碎裂吧。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/gtjgr7em4doim0yxrkbwnvfkfrmpst9.mp3","text":"这一切最好永远都不要被人知晓。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/qp9u4e3zcpjh8myhgrr95a1vmvh1lna.mp3","text":"处理得很干净，不会有人找到他们的痕迹。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/95/5j9l3c6k2lq9y2hwm287r2opii5dflu.mp3","text":"还在掌控之内的疏漏，剩下的交给我。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/5tk52tkplf5snildyxhpsqlo3qak57w.mp3","text":"补救的手段永远都有，别被愤怒冲昏了头。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:6/64/slhqjpi5nxdadhkzz8powo085u5mwtw.mp3","text":"不需要太宽敞的地方，但装饰可以再雕琢一下。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:6/64/67hxgd59srqqlmv3jm4cppsyy8d8oyj.mp3","text":"你最好对刚才的举动有一个解释。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:0/04/1pfczg4yz7m6b7pt3kt12v5gh49tz66.mp3","text":"刚出炉的菠萝油......你也想吃吗？","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/lsotbtz6mh3bixt5tcp7g98envd5wut.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/9vedvkh3q23xnnszaqk864o7pnkldxw.mp3","text":"新年快乐。爸有一些外国朋友，在这个日子他也会尽一些礼节，而寄去的贺信通常都由我代笔。喏，这封是给你的。这一年来你也操劳了不少事，辛苦了。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:1/13/qfvqh5qpufn4yd2nen16eveandgczuw.mp3","text":"希望你没有遇到什么麻烦。","alt":"voice/char_4080_lin/cn_042.mp3"}]}}